Allow for cross-project subscriptions to be made as well as the option to use a subscription vs a pubsub trigger (closes #140).

```
@app.topic('test', project="CROSS_PROJECT")
def cross_project(data):
    return 

@app.topic('test', use_subscription=True)
def subsciption(data):
    return 
```

